		<table class="Table1" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">  <tbody><tr> <td> <div class="InnerTableContainer" style="max-width: unset;"> <table style="width:100%;"><tbody><tr><td>{{ config['lua']['serverName'] }} is an online role-playing game in which thousands of players from all over the world meet everyday. In order to ensure that the game is fun for everyone, {{ config['lua']['serverName'] }} expects all players to behave in a reasonable and respectful manner.<br><br>
